# Build output
build/

# Third-party paper sources kept locally for reference only. Not part of this
# paper's build, and 21MB of figures would bloat both git history and the
# Overleaf project. See _reference_paper/PROVENANCE.md for how to re-fetch.
_reference_paper/*
!_reference_paper/PROVENANCE.md

# The contest platform's own source, cloned locally on 2026-08-19 to write
# Section 4 (HL-Arena) from the apparatus rather than from recollection.
# git@github.com:Aoraku/AgentBench.git -- read-only reference, never a submodule
# and never committed here: it is a separate project with its own history, and
# this repo pushes to Overleaf, which would receive the whole tree.
# NOTE the name collision, already recorded in main.tex: this is NOT the
# AgentBench of arXiv 2308.03688. Same name, unrelated project. Whenever Section 4
# cites or describes this platform, say which one it is.
_platform/

